{'symbol': 'LEN', 'date': '2022-01-12 17:13:00', 'title': 'LENNAR CORPORATION INCREASES ANNUAL DIVIDEND TO $1.50 PER SHARE', 'text': "MIAMI, JAN. 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LENNAR CORPORATION (NYSE: LEN AND LEN.B), ONE OF THE NATION'S LEADING HOMEBUILDERS, ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS INCREASED ITS ANNUAL DIVIDEND TO $1.50 PER SHARE FROM $1.00 PER SHARE, RESULTING IN A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.375 PER SHARE FOR BOTH CLASS A AND CLASS B COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON FEBRUARY 10, 2022 TO HOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON JANUARY 27, 2022."}